    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/685329c8aaf1a1060e39c96b8dcdfcf7.poster.avif?t=1718041454\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/685329c8aaf1a1060e39c96b8dcdfcf7.webm?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/685329c8aaf1a1060e39c96b8dcdfcf7.mp4?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Pawns</h2>In every randomly generated island, you control workers called &quot;Pawns&quot;.<br>These pawns can be assigned to do errands, RTS-style.<br>Pawns will also do smaller errands, eat, and perform necessities automatically, leaving you only to control what you focus on at a time.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/8a95d969f208e54531c84e643d7a3c8b.poster.avif?t=1718041454\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/8a95d969f208e54531c84e643d7a3c8b.webm?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/8a95d969f208e54531c84e643d7a3c8b.mp4?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Kingdom</h2>Upgrading your island town hall unlocks further progression, such as specialized professions for the pawns!<br>Expand your kingdom as you gather resources and craft items.<br>Buildings such as the workshop allow pawns to be assigned to complete crafting bills ordered.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/0eb9eff87b189aa94b97ef777d7a7bc2.poster.avif?t=1718041454\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/0eb9eff87b189aa94b97ef777d7a7bc2.webm?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/0eb9eff87b189aa94b97ef777d7a7bc2.mp4?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategize Combat</h2>You are not alone on this island and must confront the wildlife and monsters with fighters such as knights and archers.<br>Sometimes you might get raided by mischievous invaders, so preparation is necessary.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/36201c6540a299b31a218fe5f7adfe56.poster.avif?t=1718041454\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/36201c6540a299b31a218fe5f7adfe56.webm?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/36201c6540a299b31a218fe5f7adfe56.mp4?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Mysteries</h2>Every island holds unique discoveries to be made, and sometimes the only way to find out is to take a risk.<br>Maybe you'll find out who that necromancer on the other island really is!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/685329c8aaf1a1060e39c96b8dcdfcf7.poster.avif?t=1718041454\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/685329c8aaf1a1060e39c96b8dcdfcf7.webm?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/685329c8aaf1a1060e39c96b8dcdfcf7.mp4?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Pawns</h2>In every randomly generated island, you control workers called &quot;Pawns&quot;.<br>These pawns can be assigned to do errands, RTS-style.<br>Pawns will also do smaller errands, eat, and perform necessities automatically, leaving you only to control what you focus on at a time.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/8a95d969f208e54531c84e643d7a3c8b.poster.avif?t=1718041454\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/8a95d969f208e54531c84e643d7a3c8b.webm?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/8a95d969f208e54531c84e643d7a3c8b.mp4?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Kingdom</h2>Upgrading your island town hall unlocks further progression, such as specialized professions for the pawns!<br>Expand your kingdom as you gather resources and craft items.<br>Buildings such as the workshop allow pawns to be assigned to complete crafting bills ordered.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/0eb9eff87b189aa94b97ef777d7a7bc2.poster.avif?t=1718041454\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/0eb9eff87b189aa94b97ef777d7a7bc2.webm?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/0eb9eff87b189aa94b97ef777d7a7bc2.mp4?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategize Combat</h2>You are not alone on this island and must confront the wildlife and monsters with fighters such as knights and archers.<br>Sometimes you might get raided by mischievous invaders, so preparation is necessary.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/36201c6540a299b31a218fe5f7adfe56.poster.avif?t=1718041454\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/36201c6540a299b31a218fe5f7adfe56.webm?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798790/extras/36201c6540a299b31a218fe5f7adfe56.mp4?t=1718041454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Mysteries</h2>Every island holds unique discoveries to be made, and sometimes the only way to find out is to take a risk.<br>Maybe you'll find out who that necromancer on the other island really is!",
    "short_description": "Island survival RTS, with mysteries behind every corner. Assign your pawns to gather, craft, fight, study, and do other errands for your kingdom. Every randomly generated island holds unique secrets to be uncovered. As the Duke of Pawnholm, will you lead your pawns to prosperity ...or to calamity?",
